          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ਲੱਭਣਾ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਲੱਭਣਾ — labbhṇā — \"to find, to look for\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਲੱਭਣਾ (labbhṇā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from labhyate, \"is taken\" (CDIAL 10950)."
            }
          ]
        },
